('Germany', 'Munich tenders the Michaelibad heat-station excavation', [('TED 766383-2026', 'https://ted.europa.eu/en/notice/-/detail/766383-2026')], 'Tender', 'SWM seeks the heat-station excavation at its Michaelibad deep-geothermal project: about 2,250 m², approximately 16.3 m below ground, and roughly 37,300 m³ of excavation/disposal. Works include diaphragm walls, foundation piles, anchors, micropiles and dewatering. This is surface construction, not geothermal well drilling.', ('Requests by 7 Dec 2026, 13:00 CET', '2026-12-07'), [7]),
