('Netherlands', 'OMV selected for Amsterdam–Amstelveen development', [('TED 769576-2026', 'https://ted.europa.eu/en/notice/-/detail/769576-2026')], 'Tender', 'Amsterdam’s engineering bureau names OMV GeoTherm NL B.V. as winner. The contract covers feasibility, seismic research, data analysis, site selection, design, permit applications and an investment decision. Realisation and operation follow that decision. The award decision dates from 9 September; this week’s notice publication is not a drilling start.', None, [7]),
