('Poland', 'Kutno secures more than PLN 59m for geothermal heat', [('Original source', 'https://www.gov.pl/web/nfosigw/geotermia-dla-kutna-dzieki-srodkom-z-nfosigw-powstanie-nowoczesna-cieplownia-wykorzystujaca-energie-z-wnetrza-ziemi-')], 'Funding', 'The national environmental fund announced a grant-and-loan agreement exceeding PLN 59m for ECO Kutno’s geothermal plant and city-network connection. Total investment is about PLN 109m. The project includes two wells, pipework and associated infrastructure. The planned 6.4 MW installation would produce nearly 46,000 MWh of heat annually: forecasts, not operating results.', None, [7]),
('Germany', 'Münster investigates another cold heat-network site', [('Original source', 'https://www.stadtwerke-muenster.de/unternehmen/presse/pressemitteilungen/434621/stadtwerke-suchen-nach-erdwarme-an-der-kotterstrasse')], 'Project', 'The utility scheduled a 300 m exploratory borehole at Kötterstraße in Handorf for 4 November, to measure temperatures and ground conditions for a possible cold heating-and-cooling network. Its 2 November release also confirms completion of 39 boreholes across three fields at nearby Kirschgarten, reaching 250 m. The new exploration was expected to take two days; completion at Kötterstraße has not been confirmed in the source.', None, [7]),
